   "data": {
    "description": "<i>A chart of the wreck that shows a sealed chamber missing from every other plan.</i><br><br><b>The Quarantined Archive</b> · Battle Arena<br>Difficulty: ★★☆☆☆<br><b>Chance drops:</b> Reliquary Seal 25% · Rotted Reliquary Seal 1% · Haul pages 1.5% each · Sealwright's Seal variant 1% · Sealed Treasury 5%<br><b>Choose one:</b> Archive Chart Case · Sage's Strongbox · Skyglass Token<br><b>At the seals:</b> a wrong answer brings the guard and drops the Treasury chance to 3%. Breaking the seal adds a fight for 2 Core Rot.<br><i>Spent when the run starts. No refills between fights; once inside, you leave by winning, falling or abandoning. Claim any waiting reward first.</i>",
    "rarity": "RARE"
   }
