   "name": "Chart of the Captain's Watch: text, Rare",
   "data": {
    "description": "<i>The Captain's own chart of the wreck's command decks.</i><br><br><b>The Captain's Watch</b> · Battle Arena<br>Difficulty: ★★☆☆☆<br><b>Chance drops:</b> The Last Heading 25% (45% after the dawn watch) · The Rotted Heading 1% · Haul pages 1.5% each · Wayfinder's Heading variant 1% · Sealed Treasury 4–6%<br><b>Choose one:</b> Skyglass Coffer · 1,000,000 ryo · Skyglass Token<br><b>Terms:</b> before each fight, take the Oathkeeper's term for a harder fight and a bigger haul.<br><b>At the end:</b> claim the stores, or stand the dawn watch (lose it and keep only what you held).<br><i>Spent when the run starts. No refills between fights; once inside, you leave by winning, falling or abandoning. Claim any waiting reward first.</i>",
    "rarity": "RARE"
   }
